Changes made relative to upstream Autorun-rs:

  * Added autorun/src/ipc/ -- a loopback JSON control server (127.0.0.1:3005)
    exposing lua execution, console command execution, console output capture,
    scripthook file read/write, and dump notifications to external editors.
  * Added console output capture by wrapping print/Msg/MsgN/MsgC in the target
    lua realm (autorun/src/ipc/console.rs).
  * Emitted IPC events from the existing dumper and painttraverse hooks
    (autorun/src/hooks/).
  * Added vscode-autorun/ -- the GLuaBridge VSCode extension, a client for the
    above providing run-on-save, a console terminal, a dump-folder mount and a
    Lua runner sidebar.
  * Removed the unused `lupat` dependency, whose upstream repository no longer
    resolves.
  * Dropped a call to tinyget's removed `with_timeout` in autorun/src/version.rs.
